WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.300
My people died, and you have them talking about like it's a wonderful situation.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.700
They make you feel guilty, and a lot of people don't get over that.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:11.100
They just don't get over it.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.380
I think they convince the people.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.340
Do wealthy people leave, too, or not?

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.820
Places like Portland, are the wealthy people leaving?

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:19.900
People that can leave, are they leaving?

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.580
I think that they're moving to the areas that have been gentrified.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:28.059
The Oregon governor, when she was saying, we don't need Trump here, she's walking around.

00:00:28.059 --> 00:00:29.780
It's a very tight shot, if you notice that.

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:33.419
She said, Portland's just fine, you know, look at me, and they'll focus on the couple

00:00:33.419 --> 00:00:34.419
areas of Portland that are very nice.

00:00:34.419 --> 00:00:36.980
Well, she was saying that, and there were explosions in the background.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:37.980
Yeah.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:38.980
I mean, there was a reason they cropped it in.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:42.220
We don't need this explosions in the background.

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:43.860
Anybody have anything else to say over here?

